ng a clean distribution directory has been decided upon. The script will handle exclusions to create a minimal deployment package for the target machine. This package will include the core application code, requirements, configuration files, and a batch script for ease of setup. The batch script's functionality needs to include Python checking and requirement installation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Implementation plan for Excel dynamic summary formulas, review toast & real-time sync, global re-run progress overlay, pharmaceutical prompt rules, and production deployment packaging.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Implementation Plan: Excel Dynamic Formulas, UI Synchronization, Clinical Rules & Production Packaging\\n\\nImplement dynamic Excel summary formulas, real-time UI synchronization for review actions, full-screen re-run overlay with concurrent process locking, clinical prompt refinement (brand vs generic / identical count), and a production deployment packager.\\n\\n## User Review Required\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> - **Excel Formulas in Summary Sheet**: The summary sheet will now use native Excel formulas (`=B3+B4+B5`, `=MAX(0, COUNTA(...) - 1)`, `=IF(...)`) so any edit in Excel or in the app updates all statistics dynamically.\\n> - **Brand vs Generic Substitutions**: Drugs with the same active ingredient but different trade names (e.g., Roaccutane vs generic Isotretinoin, or Zovirax vs Lovir) will be routed to \\\"يحتاج مراجعة\\\" with an explicit Arabic reason instead of being automatically matched, giving pharmacists full control.\\n> - **Concurrent Process Lock**: Once any matching process starts (new, restart, or re-run), the UI displays a full-screen backdrop with a live timer and blocks starting any new process until the current one finishes.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Proposed Changes\\n\\n### 1. Output Engine (`src/output/excel_writer.py`)\\n\\n- **Dynamic Summary Sheet with Excel Formulas**:\\n  - `إجمالي الأصناف المطلوبة`: `=B3+B4+B5`\\n  - `تم مطابقتها`: `=SUM(B8:B{7+N})` (sums warehouse matches)\\n  - `لم يُعثر عليها`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('لم يُعثر عليه'!A:A)-1)`\\n  - `تحتاج مراجعة`: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('يحتاج مراجعة'!A:A)-1)`\\n  - Warehouse details table (rows 8+):\\n    - Col 2: `=MAX(0, COUNTA('{warehouse_sheet}'!A:A)-1)`\\n    - Col 3: `=COUNTIF('يحتاج مراجعة'!D:D, \\\"{warehouse_name}\\\")`\\n  - Percentages formatted dynamically with `=IF(B2>0, B3/B2, 0)` and format `0.0%`.\\n- **Friendly Match Confidence in Arabic**:\\n  - Format raw values (`exact`, `high (0.95)`, `llm`) into professional Arabic:\\n    - `exact` -> `تطابق تام (100%)`\\n    \n<truncated 3956 bytes>","Description":"\"Implementation plan for Excel dynamic formulas, review sync, modal overlay, prompt tuning, and production packager\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/implementation_plan.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing implementation plan\"","toolSummary":"\"Create implementation_plan.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
